  "goodToKnow": "Der Produzent (die Produzentin) is a producer, of films, music or goods: der Filmproduzent, der Musikproduzent, regionale Produzenten (local producers). It's a weak noun: den Produzenten. Produzieren means to produce, and die Produktion is production. In economics, the opposite is der Verbraucher or Konsument. For manufacturers of products, German often uses der Hersteller."
